            "action_name": {
              "value": "Swallow Projectile"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: A creature the kvernknurr can see targets it with a ranged Strike\n\nRequirements: The kvernknurr doesn't have a creature grabbed in its jaws\n\nThe kvernknurr attempts to swallow the projectile, gaining a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the attack misses, the kvernknurr consumes the projectile harmlessly."
